  <item>
    <title>020 如何创造一块地毯</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6977a589ef1cf272a7a1a36a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6977a589ef1cf272a7a1a36a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 17:32:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和真正做事情的人聊天，才能获取细致入微的信息，而细节往往是最有魅力的。在我的从业经历中，接触到了许多出色的供应商，跟他们聊天你能够感受到他们对于产品的独特观察和行业的热情。《人间居住指南》今后会不定期采访这些认真、热情的供应商们。在这一系列节目都不会是付费广告，但我们也不会刻意隐去任何品牌名称，希望能开展一种超越商业利益的真诚讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目作为供应商访谈节目的第一期，我们采访了地毯初创品牌「块块与共」的主理人郜艺。她职业身份从老师到媒体人，再到市场营销，最终因为希望通过品牌来传递价值观，她选择了创业。从挑选纱线开始，创造了一个把拼接地毯做成模块生活方式的品牌。节目中郜艺分享了制造地毯的技术细节，以及她对于「品牌」的思考。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>节目内容：</span></h3><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场白及嘉宾介绍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">00:02:12</a> 嘉宾以往经历介绍：老师、媒体人、品牌运营</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">00:07:23</a> 对于「品牌」这个呈现形式的思考和讨论</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">00:11:06</a> 为什么要做地毯以及地毯在居家环境中的意义</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">00:28:42</a> 如何定义和研发一款地毯产品</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3545">00:59:05</a> 电商学入门：客服、设计、投放</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4940">01:22:20</a> 在实体空间中做品牌推广</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5311">01:28:31</a> 对于未来的愿景：小而美和走量之间的平衡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6087">01:41:27</a> 录音两个月后的回看</span><br></p><span></span><p><span>参考链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/68551777000000001d00aa9e" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/68551777000000001d00aa9e"><span>块块与共的官方小红书账号</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/68b92f250000000019017b06" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/68b92f250000000019017b06"><span>块块 in Homes 小红书账号</span></a></p><span></span><h3><span>登场人物：</span></h3><span></span><p><span>hb、郜艺</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65bf0caacace72dff880f3be/lkrvDPV0Z2b24lZ2t0bWQxcWm_6O.mp3" length="99749301" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:43:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/65bf0caacace72dff880f3be/FmEkPftJDfdMf-aPLniS5bqd3VjM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>019 蓟县小发现</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68228fc696ad230605085d31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68228fc696ad230605085d31</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hb 在去项目现场出差之余逛了逛蓟州独乐寺，并在独乐寺附近发现了一个建筑颇为惊艳的老式住宅小区。由这几个超越其时代的住宅建筑，hb 和璟璐探讨了一些关于建筑设计的既老生常谈又常谈常新的问题。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>内容提要</span></h3><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>燕山美景</span></li><span></span><li><span>古典寺庙建筑对室外空间氛围的营造</span></li><span></span><li><span>一个空间宜人、构造朴素、细节进展的住宅小区，以及这样的建筑背后的得与失</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>登场人物</span></h3><span></span><p><span>hb、璟璐</span></p><span></span><h3><span>参考图片</span></h3><span></span><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938834_671856.jpg?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_1300/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938834_671856.jpg" alt="DJI_20250510153253_0556_D.jpg"></picture></figure></div><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938823_494526.jpg?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_1300/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938823_494526.jpg" alt="DJI_20250510153928_0569_D.jpg"></picture></figure></div><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938813_897636.jpg?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_1300/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938813_897636.jpg" alt="DJI_20250510154119_0573_D.jpg"></picture></figure></div><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938803_950014.jpg?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_866/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938803_950014.jpg" alt="DJI_20250510154137_0575_D.jpg"></picture></figure></div><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938794_194147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_867/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938794_194147.jpg" alt="DJI_20250510160304_0582_D.jpg"></picture></figure></div><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938784_34325.jpg?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_975/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938784_34325.jpg" alt="IMG_6064.jpg"></picture></figure></div><div class="photo"><figure><picture><source srcset="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938776_603741.jpg?x-oss-process=image/auto-orient,1/interlace,1/quality,q_90/resize,m_lfit,w_975/format,webp"><img src="https://i.typlog.com/jnjz/8252938776_603741.jpg" alt="IMG_6071.jpg"></picture></figure></div>]]></description>
